:: R5-NPC-Riley [release5]
<<scene "img/ui/riley-discord-dm.png" "You gonna do it again?">>

Discord notification. Riley. A voice message, which is unusual. Riley usually types. I tap play.

//"Dude. DUDE. I just. okay. I've been modding your chat for a year and a half. I have seen your chat do a lot of things. I have never, and I mean literally never, seen anything close to what happened tonight. That wasn't just a viewer spike. That was a vibe shift. Chat was different. They weren't watching a streamer play a game. They were watching something happen in real time and they all knew it and nobody could look away. Including me."//

A pause. Riley's breathing. Then, quieter.

//"Also, like. You looked really good, and I don't mean that in a weird way. I mean that in a. you looked like you, but more. Like the volume got turned up on something. I don't know. It's late and I'm being weird. Ignore me. But also don't ignore me because I'm right. Night."//

The voice message ends.

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "Riley" "Discord DM" "R">>
<<msg "" "Thanks Ry. Wild night." "right">>
<<msg "" "You gonna do it again?" "left">>
</div>

The question sits on the screen. Blue light, black text, the weight of a future compressed into six words.

<hr class="pt-hr">

<div class="pt-choice-label">Riley</div>
<div class="pt-choices">
<<link "The algorithm spoke. I think I have to." "R5-Riley-A">><</link>>
<<link "I don't know. Maybe." "R5-Riley-B">><</link>>
<<link "It was a one-time thing." "R5-Riley-C">><</link>>
</div>

