:: R5-NPC-LunaFrag [release5]
DM from LunaFrag. She's still awake, still buzzing from the tournament, still processing the fact that their punishment bet turned one of them into a viral moment.

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "LunaFrag" "Direct message" "L">>
<<msg "" "Ethan. I'm not gonna sugarcoat this. I've been streaming for two years and my best night was 1,200 concurrent. You did 5,000 in a skirt. Do you understand what just happened?" "left">>
<<msg "" "I'm still processing." "right">>
<<msg "" "Process faster. Here's what I'm seeing. Three clip accounts reposted you. Two gaming news sites are writing about it. Your follower growth is a vertical line. You know what the gaming world calls this? A character arc. You just started one." "left">>
<<msg "" "It was a punishment bet." "right">>
<<msg "" "It WAS a punishment bet. Now it's a brand. That's how this works. Nobody starts out wanting to be the thing that makes them famous. But the market decides, and the market just decided." "left">>
</div>

She sends a screenshot of my follower graph. It looks like a cliff face viewed from below. Straight up.

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "LunaFrag" "Direct message" "L">>
<<msg "" "Think about what you want to do with this. Because the window doesn't stay open forever. I've seen it happen. Viral moment, streamer doesn't follow up, viewers evaporate. You have maybe two weeks before the algorithm moves on." "left">>
</div>

<hr class="pt-hr">

<div class="pt-choice-label">LunaFrag</div>
<div class="pt-choices">
<<link "You think I should keep doing it?" "R5-LunaFrag-A">><</link>>
<<link "The numbers are hard to argue with." "R5-LunaFrag-B">><</link>>
</div>

