:: R5-NPC-TTVShadowMerc [release5]
TTVShadowMerc, one of my regulars. Been in my chat for eight months. Competitive FPS loyalist. The kind of viewer who's here for the gameplay and roasts anyone who brings up anything else. He DMs me on Discord.

<div class="pt-phone">
<<phonehead "TTVShadowMerc" "Direct message" "T">>
<<msg "" "Yo E. Real talk." "left">>
<<msg "" "What's up." "right">>
<<msg "" "The femboy thing. I gotta be honest. I came in tonight ready to laugh. Like, pity watch the punishment and move on. But then you loaded up and you looked. man, I don't know how to say this without being weird." "left">>
<<msg "" "Just say it." "right">>
<<msg "" "You looked good, and chat was right, your energy was completely different. You were looser. Faster with the jokes. The triple kill in round six? That was the best play I've seen from you in months, and you were wearing a SKIRT. What the hell." "left">>
<<msg "" "I don't know what that means. But I've been watching you grind for eight months and tonight was the first time I thought this guy could go big, and you were dressed as a girl when I thought it. Make of that what you will." "left">>
</div>

<hr class="pt-hr">

<div class="pt-choice-label">TTVShadowMerc</div>
<div class="pt-choices">
<<link "Appreciate that, Merc. Honestly." "R5-ShadowMerc-A">><</link>>
<<link "You're not gonna make it weird, right?" "R5-ShadowMerc-B">><</link>>
</div>

